-- Import of PM-DF 2025 official exam items for cargo "Oficial Policial
-- Militar – 2º Tenente" (Edital nº 03/2025 – DGP/PMDF, de 31 de janeiro de
-- 2025, Concurso Público de Admissão ao Curso de Formação de Oficiais
-- (CFO), banca CEBRASPE). This is the ONLY cargo offered by this edital
-- (single-cargo CFO admission concurso; no soldado/praça cargo exists in
-- this selection process, confirmed by reading the edital's cover, item 2
-- "DO CARGO DE OFICIAL POLICIAL MILITAR – 2º TENENTE", and by the fact the
-- Google Drive "PM DF 2025" folder holds files for a single cargo/matriz
-- only).
--
-- Source material read verbatim from Google Drive folder "PM DF 2025"
-- (parentId 1vx3TSmDUanCZHfM0-eFdoB-WF8zu-v0w):
--   - Prova P1 (Conhecimentos Gerais, itens 1-40) + gabarito preliminar com
--     justificativas: "PROVA OBJETIVA (P1) E GABARITO PRELIMINAR COM
--     JUSTIFICATIVAS.pdf" (fileId 1roid9hvhPggygB36SqAQKVudP5TmMPnl).
--   - Prova P2 (Conhecimentos Específicos, itens 41-80) + gabarito
--     preliminar com justificativas: "PROVA OBJETIVA (P2) E GABARITO
--     PRELIMINAR COM JUSTIFICATIVAS.pdf" (fileId
--     1uBURKMeAI5d_6P5N88o4DtuKHcGrDyof).
--   - Gabarito oficial definitivo P1 (itens 1-40, matriz
--     MATRIZ_064_PMDF_CG1_00): "GABARITO DEFINITIVO – PROVA OBJETIVA
--     (P1).pdf" (fileId 1jhL62-nfIRc2CK2FgAKnWdjZZvci-wMs).
--   - Gabarito oficial definitivo P2 (itens 41-80, matriz
--     MATRIZ_064_PMDF_001_00): "GABARITO DEFINITIVO – PROVA OBJETIVA
--     (P2).pdf" (fileId 1Fmu0tyNLUXiylujFKQZDq5qlPY7CF6PT).
--   - Edital de abertura (cargo, remuneração, fases): "Edital n 03 2025 –
--     Abertura.pdf" (fileId 11GMqZBGWuj4ujD1C7SMU9gdT80F4Plet).
--   Prova discursiva and its padrão de resposta (P3) were also present in
--   the folder but are NOT imported here: official_exam_questions only
--   models objective (multiple-choice) items; the discursiva is a
--   free-text essay item outside this table's shape.
--
-- Definitive answer key (X = anulada), cross-checked against both the
-- gabarito preliminar-com-justificativas PDFs and the gabarito definitivo
-- PDFs (identical sequences):
--   1-20:  B C A A A A E B B D E D D A B E B C D E
--   21-40: D B E A A D C B X A C D A B E A E D C A
--   41-60: D C E E C X E D C D B E C A C B B X A X
--   61-80: B C B X D X A B B A A B C B D X D C E B
-- 6 items anulados: 29, 46, 58, 60, 64, 66, 76 (7 total, confirmed against
-- both gabarito definitivo PDFs).
--
-- Each item's question_text is the verbatim command + alternatives (A-E)
-- as printed in the prova; raw_extraction additionally appends, after
-- " || JUSTIFICATIVAS: ", the verbatim per-alternative justificativa text
-- from the gabarito preliminar com justificativas PDF (task instruction:
-- justificativa goes in raw_extraction/legal_basis, never in review_note).
-- Discipline breakdown (subject column) derived from the prova's own area
-- tags (e.g. PMDF064CG1A02..., PMDF064001A04...) and section headers, not
-- guessed.
--
-- CEBRASPE uses A-E alternatives here (not C/E Certo/Errado); the
-- official_answer check constraint was already widened to accept
-- ('A','B','C','D','E','X') by 20260926210000_pp_acre_2023_official_exam_import.sql,
-- so no further alter is needed. The (contest_name,career_name,exam_year,
-- item_number) unique key was already established by
-- 20260929240000_pf_2021_delegado_import.sql.
--
-- All content_status values are 'under_review' (or 'annulled' for the 7 X
-- items) — never 'active', per CONTENT_GOVERNANCE.md.

